        "snippet": "ch 31, 2025, no repurchases of shares were made by the Company under this authorization. On December 31, 2025, we adopted a Rule 10b-18 and 10b5-1 trading plan (the \"10b5-1 Plan\") which allows the Company to purchase shares of our common stock under our announced repurchase programs during certain restricted blackout periods. The 10b5-1 Plan allows for the purchase of up to an aggregate of the lower of (i) common stock totaling a combined $2,000,000 purchase price, excluding commissions; or (ii) 350,000 shares of common stock. Shares of common stock purchased pursuant to the 10b5-1 Plan may on",
